---
description: Delta Convergence project rules (public contest repo)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root; it is the canonical instruction file for every agent.

- The spec is `docs/PRD.md`. Contracts and rules R1–R9 in §4 are authoritative.
- Work to the acceptance criteria of the task you were handed (the task board is kept locally and not published). Post blocking questions in the channel you were given.
- `packages/delta-core` stays pure: no I/O, no Cloudflare types, no LLM calls.
- Cloud agents never deploy and never touch secrets. Write code and tests, then open a PR.
- Public repo: no secrets, account IDs, client or person names, or private paths in tracked files.
